  exerciseText: 'Movement System capable of moving a character and interacting with
    obstacles.


    In this Scenario, WASD to Move the Player character around.
    There are physics so the Player cannot go through walls and can push pebbles
    around.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so
    if you want to keep your own personal implementation of this System then make
    a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
